---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - NovaTools"
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for NovaTools client-side utility suite."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
    <div class="nt-window p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#111214] dark:text-[#F3F4F6]">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] dark:text-[#9CA3AF] font-mono">
        Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4B5563] dark:text-[#D1D5DB] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="nt-card p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111214] dark:text-[#F3F4F6] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using NovaTools (<a href="https://toolboxs.tech" class="font-bold text-[#111214] dark:text-[#60A5FA] underline">toolboxs.tech</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, discontinue use immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="nt-card p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111214] dark:text-[#F3F4F6] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. License & Client Runtime Execution</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools grants you a free, non-exclusive license to use the browser-based utilities for personal and commercial media/document processing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because all computation occurs directly on your client hardware, you are solely responsible for ensuring your machine has sufficient memory and CPU capacity to transcode target media.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="nt-card p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111214] dark:text-[#F3F4F6] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools is provided on an "AS IS" basis without warranties of any kind. While our in-browser processing algorithms are rigorously tested, we advise retaining original backups of all source files.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
